            "text": "### ৫. অংক করার জন্য জাদুকরী সূত্র (Formulas):",
            "start": 2327,
            "end": 2373
          },
          {
            "id": "p36",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "মোল সংখ্যাকে আমরা ছোট হাতের **$n$** দিয়ে প্রকাশ করি।",
            "start": 2375,
            "end": 2427
          },
          {
            "id": "p37",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list",
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "1. ভর দেওয়া থাকলে:",
            "start": 2429,
            "end": 2447
          },
          {
            "id": "p38",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "   $$n = \\frac{w}{M}$$",
            "start": 2448,
            "end": 2470
          },
          {
            "id": "p39",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "   *(এখানে, $w$ = দেওয়া ভর গ্রামে, $M$ = মোলার ভর)*",
            "start": 2471,
            "end": 2522
          },
          {
            "id": "p40",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list",
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "2. কণার সংখ্যা দেওয়া থাকলে:",
            "start": 2524,
            "end": 2551
          },
          {
            "id": "p41",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "   $$n = \\frac{N}{N_A}$$",
            "start": 2552,
            "end": 2576
          },
          {
            "id": "p42",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "   *(এখানে, $N$ = মোট কণার সংখ্যা, $N_A = 6.022 \\times 10^{23}$)*",
            "start": 2577,
            "end": 2642
          },
          {
            "id": "p43",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list",
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "3. STP-তে গ্যাসের আয়তন দেওয়া থাকলে:",
            "start": 2644,
            "end": 2679
          },
          {
            "id": "p44",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "   $$n = \\frac{V}{22.4}$$",
            "start": 2680,
            "end": 2705
          },
          {
            "id": "p45",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "   *(এখানে, $V$ = লিটারে দেওয়া আয়তন)*",
            "start": 2706,
            "end": 2743
          },
          {
            "id": "p46",
